OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sat 19 Sep to Mon 28 Sep
OL,6,FThe weather will remain changeable.
OL,7,FOccasional rain or showers will push
OL,8,Fin from the North Atlantic, most
OL,9,Ffrequent across northern and western
OL,10,Fparts of the UK, accompanied by strong
OL,11,Fwinds at times. However, there will
OL,12,Falso be some reasonably dry and more
OL,13,Fsettled periods in between these
OL,14,Fsystems, especially across southern
OL,15,Fareas. There is a chance settled
OL,16,Fweather may expand further northwards
OL,17,Fduring the final week of September.
OL,18,FTemperatures for the period as a whole
OL,19,Fwill probably be close to average
OL,20,Foverall, but there is scope for some
OL,21,Frather warm days at times, as well as
OL,22,Frelatively cool nights which may bring
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,23,Fthe occasional grass frost.
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
